<title>UK: BOE invites band 1,2 bills, shortage 1.75 bln stg.</title>
<headline>BOE invites band 1,2 bills, shortage 1.75 bln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England invited UK money market operators to offer band 1 and 2 bills and offered an unrestricted bill/FRG repo to September 16 and 17 to help alleviate a forecast liquidity shortage of 1.75 billion stg.</p>
</text>
